window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><i>New York Times</i> best-selling author Gena Showalter, Shannon K. Butcher, Jessica Andersen, and Deidre Knight present a steamy collection of all-new novellas featuring sexy paranormal hunters. With shadowy creatures, intoxicating magic, vividly imagined worlds, and sizzling passion, this is an anthology no fan of paranormal romance will want to miss. </p> <p>In Showalter's \"Ever Night\", Rose Pascal is swept into a dark, haunting world every year on her birthday---a world ruled by a warrior king who hunts her kind. Neither of them can deny the passion that soon consumes them both. In Butcher's \"The Collector\", demon hunter Neal Etan sets out to acquire a powerful artifact but finds much more in beautiful Viviana Rowan. The antique dealer's touch strengthens his magic---and her life may be in Neal's hands if they don't recover the artifact in time. In Andersen's \"Crystal Skull\", archaeologist Natalie Albright's dig gets shut down amid rumors that she has awakened the local demons. But when the terrifying underworld creatures attack, Natalie must team up with her ex to survive. As they fight the ancient menace, they discover a destiny that binds them together---and threatens to tear them apart. And in Knight's \"Red Angel\", Jamie Angel, leader of the deadly Nightshades, has tracked every kind of monster and demon that roams the darkness, but none of his experiences can prepare him for falling in love with one of the creatures he's been trained to destroy.</p>"; 
